ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Photoshop file.
It is a text brief saved as .psd so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Photoshop to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Cubism
Board: /styles/cubism
Companions: cubism-starter.html, cubism-study.ai, cubism-study.psd

Document
2400 × 2400 px, 300 ppi. Ground #b7aa9a.

Layer stack, top to bottom
- Label, plain sans, two words
- Pasted pattern (a stripe fill, clipped to a rectangle)
- Second view of the object (rim or ellipse)
- First view (side plane)
- Table edge, #5c534c
- Ground

Rules
The pattern layer is above the painted planes, so it reads as laid on.
No drop shadow that makes a deep room. No photograph. No copied collage.
